WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.500
A visitor signs. Sanket Setu helps both people take the next step.

00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:09.000
Start the camera. Keep one supported hand in frame and in good light. Two-hand movement is tracked live, not translated as a sentence.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:13.500
Check the suggested reading together. A thumbs-up is an informal cue; context can change its meaning. Confirm before it is added.

00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:18.000
Confirmed text can be spoken. Staff can reply with text or voice-to-text. For unsupported messages, choose a phrase or type it.
